user-attachments/assets/75002a5a-caf1-4469-9516-47de9586509a\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a standard material with alpha-to-coverage enabled, apply a texture with alpha to it.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[alpha-to-coverage-testing.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/33282776/alpha-to-coverage-testing.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124355/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124355/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}